    996  f707							; Feature-record dispatch ($80 phase / $81 vcrunch / $82 hcrunch — Phase 4):
    997  f707							; armed/overlap/kill tests live in bank3 (HOVFeatEntry). $80 phase: b5 armed
    998  f707							; (staged by PhaseBlink each VBL) + candidate-box overlap → shared Hot hit
    999  f707							; (Temp b7 → bank0 `jsr LoseLife`); kill gated on armed-and-not-removed
   1000  f707							; (`and #$60 / cmp #$20`), latches b6, PhaseBlink punch forced OFF while b6
   1001  f707							; set (walls REMOVED, same-room only — EnterRoom zeroes the mask).
   1002  f707							; $81 vcrunch: sprite shutter — the kill rides the OverlayTramp MISS path
   1003  f707							; (OvShutTest/OvShutBand, MetaB b7 gate) because the punched cell never
   1004  f707							; trips this walk. The record path (loop push + HOVFeatPre's 4 field pushes
   1005  f707							; + bank3 jsr HOVvcrunch) measured SP=$F6 = real BombTimer ($F7) stomp
   1006  f707							; (sim_bomb_fuse mirror stomp, 2026-10-13) — skip the record here.
   1007  f707							; Entered with Y = record base + pushed Y (loop invariant), A = mask.
   1008  f707							; 15B kept: the cmp/beq/jmp + pad replace the old tramp byte-for-byte —
   1009  f707							; the BombEnemyBlastBody $FD87 pin (kernel tramp operand) must not move.
